      "kind": "module",
      "name": "PAUTH",
      "key_points": [
        "The credit-card authorization extension: it processes authorisation requests from merchant request to approve/decline, with fraud detection, across IMS DB, DB2 and MQ.",
        "Pending authorisations live in the IMS database DBPAUTP0; the fraud/reference side is DB2, and the screens are its own CSD group.",
        "It is reached from the core CardDemo main menu, which names COPAUS0C as a menu program."
